# Normalize line endings to LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# Prettier's `endOfLine` default is "lf", and `npm run format-check` is the CI style
# gate. Without this, a Windows runner checks out CRLF (core.autocrlf=true is the
# default there) and Prettier reports every file as unformatted — which is exactly
# what happened the first time format-check ran in CI, flagging 50 files that are
# byte-identical to what Prettier writes on Linux/macOS.
#
# `text=auto` still lets git detect binaries (images, .vsix), so those are untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
